    airo:sourceDocId "9503" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/77149d894ffc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In his 2017 annual report, Tony Porter the Surveillance Camera Commissioner said automatic facial recognition is \"fascinating\" but it can be used for \"intrusive capabilities\" and have \"crass\" applications." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9506" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7c92f23a501f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Civil liberties group Big Brother Watch criticised the use of the technology, saying in a tweet: \"Not only is real-time facial recognition a threat to civil liberties, it is a dangerously inaccurate policing tool.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1765" .

